    seoTitle: "KSA Netherlands Mandatory Intervention Standards & Cruks Rules April 2026 | iGaming Pulse",
    metaDescription: "The KSA published detailed player protection rules on April 6, 2026 — mandatory at-risk intervention standards and tightened Cruks self-exclusion requirements, including reporting obligations when players refuse enrollment.",
