    metaDescription: "Maine became the 8th US state to legalise online casino under LD 1164 — granting exclusive rights to the four Wabanaki tribal nations, with Penobscot Nation partnering with Caesars Digital and the Passamaquoddy Tribe signing with DraftKings. Launch expected late 2026 or early 2027.",
