    seoTitle: "Stake.com Eyes Rush Street Interactive Acquisition: Crypto Casino M&A Meets US iGaming Regulation | iGaming Pulse",
    metaDescription: "Stake.com has reportedly identified Rush Street Interactive as a potential acquisition target — a deal that would give the world's largest crypto casino plug-in US regulated iGaming access, but faces multi-state gaming board suitability reviews.",
    likes: 58,
