    seoTitle: "Las Vegas Strip Net Income Collapses 81% FY 2025: Record Revenue Meets Cost Crisis | iGaming Pulse",
    metaDescription: "Las Vegas Strip casinos posted an 81.2% net income collapse in FY 2025 — falling to $154.2M despite $21.08B in near-record total revenue — a structural cost crisis driven by labour inflation, utility costs, and debt service that exposes deep profitability challenges in gaming's flagship market.",
