    seoTitle: "Brazil Finance Minister Calls for Higher Betting Tax 2026: Stricter Rules Signal | iGaming Pulse",
    metaDescription: "Brazil's Finance Minister Dario Durigan calls for cigarette-style regulation of the betting sector — higher taxes, stricter advertising rules, and mandatory harm reduction — signalling a major compliance shift for operators in one of Latin America's largest iGaming markets.",
