    metaDescription: "Games Valley research identifies 'invisible friction' — slow loads, payment delays, confusing UI, unclear bonus terms — as the primary driver of silent player churn in 2026, with players leaving without complaints and operators unable to diagnose the root cause without dedicated friction monitoring.",
